ed_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":13,"created_at":"2025-11-26T07:26:03Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T18:44:41Z","closed_at":"2026-03-06T18:44:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113178","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113178","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113178.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113178.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-06T18:44:27Z"},"body":"TL;DR\r\n- Updates the documentation for `Tree.create_item(), Tree.set_columns() & Tree.clear()`\r\n- Adds error messages for `Tree.create_item(), Tree.set_columns() & Tree.clear()`\r\n- Closes #103101\r\n- Supersedes #105969.\r\n\r\nThis PR updates the documentation for `Tree.create_item(), Tree.set_columns() & Tree.clear()` & tells the user that all 3 methods can fail during mouse selection events. It also adds error messages for `Tree.create_item(), Tree.set_columns() & Tree.clear()` \r\n\r\n\r\nThe user will get the following error message if attempting to use any of the 3 methods during mouse selection events (Following @RedMser's comment in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105969#pullrequestreview-2810059679):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"945\" height=\"290\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3949c691-6753-44f6-aa3d-045d1447af81\" />\r\n\r\n(This is a test using the script provided by @kleonc in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103101#issuecomment-2673123694)\r\n\r\nText version:\r\n```\r\nE 0:00:02:715   tree.gd:14 @ _on_item_selected(): The tree cannot create items during mouse selection events.\r\n  <C++ Error>   Condition \"blocked > 0\" is true. Returning: nullptr\r\n  <C++ Source>  scene\\gui\\tree.cpp:5188 @ Tree::create_item()\r\n  <Stack Trace> tree.gd:14 @ _on_item_selected()\r\n```\r\n\r\n(We use `ERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG` instead of `ERR_FAIL_COND_MSG` here because Godot expects us to return a value or else we get build errors. We just return `nullptr` in this case.)\r\n\r\n### MRP:\r\nYou can test with [this](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23776082/113178-mrp.zip)\r\nIf you face any issues while testing, feel free to ping me.\r\n(The `set_text` issue is expected, it is triggered by the first issue.)\r\n(Note: I used the build made by GitHub actions.)\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> Contributed by 2LazyDevs.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113178/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113178/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}